{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Kibu is a tranquil adventure in the heart of the wilderness. As a solitary monk you must rebuild your temple, brew delicious teas, and journey into the wilds seeking out ancient spirits.  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2193150/extras/ENG_banner1.gif?t=1742413394\" /></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Embark on a tranquil adventure in a captivating wilderness, journeying through a range of unique environments and seeking out the ancient spirits of the land</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Explore mysterious lands, uncovering hidden secrets and unravelling the enigmatic stories of the world</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Harness the power of your staff as you strike out into the wilds, and master a tactile, flowing combat system to overcome hostile foes</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Turn the ruins of a long-forgotten temple into a sanctuary you can call home between adventures, bringing it to life with collections of the special things you find along the way</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/2193150?t=1742413394","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/2193150?t=1742413394","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2193150/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1742413394","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2193150/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1742413394","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"controller_support":"full","detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\